# One explicit Stage-B 70 mm positional contact-approach OUT+BACK action.  The goal carries only
# immutable plan identity and an exact confirmation token.  It deliberately
# contains no joint vector, geometry, stroke, force target, pixels, or arbitrary JSON.
string plan_hash
string stage_a_receipt_sha256
string authorization_id
string confirmation_token
